WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.504 line:-1 align:center size:84%
MV AutoML Studio. From any dataset
to a validated model, without

00:00:05.504 --> 00:00:07.850 line:-1 align:center size:84%
writing a single line of code.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.699 line:-1 align:center size:84%
You drop the file and the platform
profiles it on its own: it detects

00:00:12.699 --> 00:00:17.126 line:-1 align:center size:84%
each column's type, the data
quality, and the free text, which it

00:00:17.126 --> 00:00:19.850 line:-1 align:center size:84%
vectorises so it competes with the
rest.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.450 line:-1 align:center size:84%
The correlation map shows at a
glance which variables move

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:26.850 line:-1 align:center size:84%
together.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.091 line:-1 align:center size:84%
You type the target in plain
language. The platform finds the

00:00:32.091 --> 00:00:36.450 line:-1 align:center size:84%
column, recognises it as a
classification problem and builds

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:37.850 line:-1 align:center size:84%
the plan.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.373 line:-1 align:center size:84%
Before training it audits for
leakage and drops whatever memorises

00:00:43.373 --> 00:00:47.850 line:-1 align:center size:84%
instead of generalising, such as
each row's identifier.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.501 line:-1 align:center size:84%
Then the models compete: it tunes
hyperparameters, tries different

00:00:54.501 --> 00:00:57.850 line:-1 align:center size:84%
families and blends the best ones.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:02.869 line:-1 align:center size:84%
The number it reports comes from the
blind holdout, the window untouched

00:01:02.869 --> 00:01:07.536 line:-1 align:center size:84%
by any decision. Zero point eight
eight AUC, with minimal degradation

00:01:07.536 --> 00:01:10.850 line:-1 align:center size:84%
against the selection window: the
model holds up.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.577 line:-1 align:center size:84%
And it explains why: every variable
with its real weight and which way

00:01:14.577 --> 00:01:18.000 line:-1 align:center size:84%
it pushes. Effective contact raises
payment; days overdue lower it.
